# `Inherits=Adwaita` is the safety net: any shape this set does not draw
# (question_arrow, zoom cursors, ...) resolves to Adwaita's artwork rather than
# dropping through to the X core font. Adwaita is installed on this box and its
# directory is on the search path the client passes in XCURSOR_PATH.
[Icon Theme]
Name=dsh
Comment=DSH Native: flat light-on-dark cursors for the native client
Inherits=Adwaita
